From 39f612a3c77320e999c048fdbb76728cde7f7f63 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xiaomi Civi 1 crDroid 13 Port <mona@lineageos.org>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:01:48 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] ksu: Integrate KernelSU-Next (legacy) with manual hooks for
 mona

Wire KernelSU-Next legacy branch (drivers/kernelsu -> ../KernelSU-Next/kernel)
for Xiaomi Civi 1 (mona, non-GKI 5.4.302-qgki with Clang 22 LTO + strict CFI):
- Enable CONFIG_KSU=y and CONFIG_KSU_MANUAL_HOOK=y in mona_QGKI.config
  (avoids kprobes <5.10 issues and sys_call_table RO/CFI patching risks;
   ensures sys_reboot supercall and init.rc injection hooks are always active)
- Backport can_umount() and path_umount() in fs/namespace.c & fs/internal.h
  so Kbuild never mutates read-only srctree inside Soong sandbox
- Add manual hooks in kernel/reboot.c, fs/exec.c (do_execveat_common,
  handling both execve and Android 17 Bionic execveat), fs/open.c,
  fs/read_write.c, fs/stat.c (vfs_statx + newfstat/fstat64),
  drivers/input/input.c, and security/selinux/avc.c

Change-Id: I9c4d1e2a7f3b5819a2d6c8e04b7a3f1e5d2c9a80
Signed-off-by: Xiaomi Civi 1 crDroid 13 Port <mona@lineageos.org>
---
 arch/arm64/configs/vendor/mona_QGKI.config |  4 +++
 drivers/Kconfig                            |  2 ++
 drivers/Makefile                           |  1 +
 drivers/input/input.c                      | 11 ++++++++
 drivers/kernelsu                           |  1 +
 fs/exec.c                                  | 14 +++++++++
 fs/internal.h                              |  1 +
 fs/namespace.c                             | 33 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 fs/open.c                                  |  9 ++++++
 fs/read_write.c                            | 11 ++++++++
 fs/stat.c                                  | 27 ++++++++++++++++--
 kernel/reboot.c                            |  9 ++++++
 security/selinux/avc.c                     |  8 ++++++
 13 files changed, 129 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create mode 120000 drivers/kernelsu

